- gates: ruff/format/mypy clean; pytest 130/130; eval-full 150/150 unsafe 0 FA 0/500; vitest 17/17;
  oxlint 0 errors; build OK; axe WCAG 2.2 AA 0 violations (mobile/desktop x light/dark)
